<title>UK: Eyecare Products says BEC to sell stake.</title>
<headline>Eyecare Products says BEC to sell stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Eyecare Products Plc said on Monday that U.S.-based BEC Group Inc agreed to sell about 15 percent of its stake in the company to Lantis Eyecare Corp for 37.5p per share.</p>
<p>As part of the deal, BEC, which currently has a 27.3 percent stake in Eyecare, gave Lantis an option to buy its remaining shares at strike prices ranging from 47.5p to 57.5p over the next two years.</p>
</text>
